蛰居；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"틀어박히다","audio":"/audio/de5d31f9f7965407db6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82634","senseId":"1","lemma":"틀어박히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖으로","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔거든.","meaning":"出，长出","explanation":"나오다：出，长出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"2","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"d7137afeb52708a5","term":"일주일","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3","entryId":"30189","definition":"从周一开始到周日的七天；或指一周。","pronunciation":["일쭈일"]},{"id":"c4bb20b6c91a2fcf","term":"내내","zh":"始终，一直","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3","entryId":"60627","definition":"从开始到最后持续着。","pronunciation":["내ː내"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"c341bdffce219a75","term":"꾹","zh":"一直，一动不动","audio":"/audio/c341bdffce219a7596ab.mp3","entryId":"36617","definition":"躲藏在看不到的地方或闷在一个地方不出来的样子。","pronunciation":["꾹"]},{"id":